<title>FRANCE: French CAC index hits new high of 2,836.14.</title>
<headline>French CAC index hits new high of 2,836.14.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Paris CAC share index hit a fresh high at 2,836.14 on Wednesday, boosted by Wall Street's rise of two percent overnight, traders said.</p>
